  triage:title "No WAL checkpoint after writer loop drain before thread exit" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-rusqlite/src/writer/mod.rs:115 no WAL checkpoint after writer loop drain, before thread exit. Minor durability gap (checkpoint not guaranteed before process exit). Fix: add PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(PASSIVE) after drain loop exits in writer_loop." ;
